e=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withTimeInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">weak</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">_</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 场景 3：NotificationCenter 循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Observer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token: NSObjectProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NotificationCenter.default.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">addObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            forName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .someNotification,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ) { [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">weak</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] notification </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notification)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notification: Notification) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"对象生命周期\">对象生命周期</h2><p>Swift 对象经历以下生命周期阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Live: 分配 + 初始化&#10;    Live --&gt; Deiniting: 强引用计数 → 0&#10;    Deiniting --&gt; Deinited: deinit 完成&#10;    Deinited --&gt; Freed: 无主引用计数 → 0&#10;    Freed --&gt; [*]: 弱引用计数 → 0(side table 释放)&#10;&#10;    Live: 强引用 &gt; 0&#10;    Deiniting: 执行 deinit&#10;    Deinited: 内存保留(unowned 可访问)&#10;    Freed: 仅 side table 存活\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Live: 分配 + 初始化\n    Live --&gt; Deiniting: 强引用计数 → 0\n    Deiniting --&gt; Deinited: deinit 完成\n    Deinited --&gt; Freed: 无主引用计数 → 0\n    Freed --&gt; [*]: 弱引用计数 → 0(side table 释放)\n\n    Live: 强引用 &gt; 0\n    Deiniting: 执行 deinit\n    Deinited: 内存保留(unowned 可访问)\n    Freed: 仅 side table 存活</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>强引用</th>\n<th>无主引用访问</th>\n<th>弱引用访问</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Live</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n<td>✅ 有效</td>\n<td>✅ 有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deiniting</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>✅ 有效</td>\n<td>返回 nil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deinited</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>⚠️ 崩溃</td>\n<td>返回 nil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Freed</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>⚠️ 崩溃</td>\n<td>返回 nil</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ARC</strong> 在编译时插入 retain/release，无运行时 GC 暂停</li>\n<li>引用计数存储在对象头部，64 位字段中包含强引用和无主引用计数</li>\n<li><strong>Side table</strong> 在存在弱引用时创建，将弱引用管理从对象解耦</li>\n<li><strong>weak</strong> 引用在对象释放后自动置 nil，需要 side table；<strong>unowned</strong> 不置零但更高效</li>\n<li><strong>循环引用</strong>是最常见的内存泄漏，通过 <code>[weak self]</code> 或 <code>[unowned self]</code> 打破</li>\n<li>对象经历 Live → Deiniting → Deinited → Freed 四个生命周期阶段</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ARC 内部机制","id":"arc-内部机制"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"引用计数存储","id":"引用计数存储"},{"level":2,"text":"Side Table","id":"side-table"},{"level":2,"text":"weak 与 unowned","id":"weak-与-unowned"},{"level":2,"text":"循环引用","id":"循环引用"},{"level":2,"text":"对象生命周期","id":"对象生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Sendable 与隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/sendable-and-isolation"},"next":{"title":"所有权与借用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/ownership-and-borrowing"}}